  "question": {
    "text": "The number of ordered pairs <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> of real numbers satisfying the system of equations <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
